      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "text" : "[Doctor]\nWell...I was going to tell you after you recover, but you should know. You can't decorate the Yai anymore. \nIn other words, you injured your wing. The arrow went through the most critical part in the wing."
    },
